WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Forward heavy punch catches standing Manon.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.750
Back heavy punch links after the punish.

3
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.300
The Overdrive projectile launches into its follow-up hits.

4
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.450
Medium-punch Sonic Hurricane follows OD Boom.

5
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.700
Hurricane hits the airborne opponent.

6
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:06.150
The projectile-to-Super route finishes with Manon falling away.
